  "typeCharacter": "Fraunces at heavy weight with soft, slightly wonky curves echoes the bold serif of the LANA logo and is set large in sentence case in wine (hero up to about 9vw, section heads around 4vw); Nunito Sans carries running text, service lists and hours at regular weight in deep aubergine, with no uppercase tracking anywhere.",
  "composition": "Header on the blush ground: the logo at left (cols 1-3), four plain text links at right and one wine call button with slightly rounded corners. Hero, about 80vh: the headline in heavy wine Fraunces spans cols 1-7 over three lines, the lead below it in Nunito Sans (cols 1-6), and the single 'Pokličite' button. Cols 8-12 hold img_03 (the balayage from behind) in a tall arch mask, bleeding off the right edge, its left foot slightly overlapping the end of the headline's last line. Section 2 is a full-width wine band: at left (cols 1-6) the call sentence in large blush Fraunces; at right (cols 7-12) the phone as a huge blush numeral, with no button. Section 3 (Cenik) on blush: the heading and ammonia note in cols 1-5; the seven services as a list with thin #e2c9cd rules in cols 1-7 (names only, short notes in muted text under Barvanje, Pramene and Svečana pričeska). Cols 9-12 hold img_02 cropped tight to the hands, scissors and the lifted strand, with no faces, in a rectangle with one cut corner. Section 4 on the #f3e3e6 surface: img_04 (the braided bridal updo) bleeds from the left edge across cols 1-7; cols 8-12 hold a short heading and text about wedding and prom updos, and a small honey ink drawing of a single flowing lock sits beneath. Section 5 (team) on blush: the heading 'V salonu delava dve', then two names set large in wine Fraunces side by side (cols 1-6 and 7-12), each with one muted line of role. Section 6 (Naročanje) on a deep aubergine field: address and parking note in cols 1-4, opening hours as a week strip in cols 5-12, below them a simple schematic map in blush and honey lines in cols 1-6, and img_01 (the salon interior) cropped wide in cols 7-12. A slim footer follows with the logo.",
  "imagery": "The client's four photos only. img_03 is the hero arch, img_02 is cropped to the hands and scissors with no faces, img_04 bleeds left in the updo section, and img_01 sits wide in the contact section on the dark field. There is one drawn piece: a single loose lock of wavy hair in thin honey #c99a5b ink, flowing like a ribbon, painted alone on the plain #f3e3e6 ground away from any text, with no head, hands or letters.",
  "signature": "A huge wine Fraunces promise about ammonia-free colour, with the honey balayage arch rising beside it and just touching its last line, as if the hair were the proof of the sentence.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Barve brez amoniaka, tudi za občutljivo lasišče",
    "lead": "V salonu na Stanetovi ulici v Celju strižemo ženske, moške in otroke, barvamo, delamo pramene, fen frizure in svečane pričeske za poroke in maturantske plese."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage for a Slovenian hair salon, 1536x1024 px, no browser window, no device frame, no perspective. Page ground: pale blush tint #fbf3f4. Text: deep aubergine #2a1418. One strong colour: wine #7a2a36, taken from the attached logo. Headings are in Fraunces, heavy, soft-curved, in sentence case; body text is in Nunito Sans regular. No gradients, no shadows, no pill buttons, no icons, no uppercase eyebrow labels. HEADER: the attached LANA logo (wine circle with a pale lock mark, LANA FRIZERSTVO wordmark) at top left; four small text links and one wine button with slightly rounded corners and blush text at top right. HERO, left-aligned on a 12-column grid: the headline set very large in heavy wine #7a2a36 Fraunces across columns 1-7 on three lines; below it a short aubergine Nunito Sans lead paragraph in columns 1-6, and one wine button. Columns 8-12: the attached photo of long wavy honey-blonde balayage hair seen from behind, in a tall arch mask with a rounded top that bleeds off the right edge and runs to the bottom of the hero. The arch's lower left edge slightly overlaps the end of the headline's last line. NEXT, partly visible below the fold: a full-width solid wine #7a2a36 band, with a blush #fbf3f4 Fraunces sentence on the left and a very large blush phone numeral on the right. Below that, on blush: a service list with thin #e2c9cd hairline rules on the left, and on the right the attached photo of a hairdresser cutting hair, cropped tight to the hands, scissors and the lifted strand, with no faces visible, in a rectangle with one cut corner. Further down: on a #f3e3e6 field, the attached bridal braided updo photo bleeding from the left edge, text on the right, and a small drawing of one flowing wavy lock of hair in thin honey #c99a5b ink on the plain ground. Then a team section with two large wine serif names side by side. Last, a deep aubergine #2a1418 contact section with blush text, an opening-hours week strip, a simple schematic map in blush and honey lines, and the attached salon interior photo cropped wide on the right. Generous whitespace, asymmetric, calm and confident."
}

